* The rept fold takes dc of any size and a count of numbers and equates; in a vsect its rept
* line defines the label in the initialized data (BUF1: rept CNT, dc.w $200).
* fixed: acdb7a5 2026-10-09 r68togas: movem's bare address long; the rept fold for any dc and equate counts; long dc lists
* expect data: 0200 0200 0200 0200 0200 0200 1234 0000
* expect sym: D BUF1 00000000
 psect rept_fold,0,0,0,0,0
CNT equ (12/4)*2
 vsect
BUF1: rept CNT
 dc.w $200
 endr
 dc.w $1234
 ends
 lea BUF1(a6),a0
 ends
